EcruteakCity_Interior8_Text_OldMan1_1::
	.string "I’m trying to uncover the secret\n"
	.string "of the legendary POKéMON that is\l"
	.string "said to land here.\p"
	.string "They say that the POKéMON has flown\n"
	.string "continuously ever since the TOWER in\l"
	.string "the West burned.\p"
	.string "So, I thought that if I had what the\n"
	.string "POKéMON has, it would be attracted\l"
	.string "by that item.\p"
	.string "I think that item is probably...\p"
	.string "A RAINBOW WING!\p"
	.string "But, where would I find one?$"

EcruteakCity_Interior8_Text_OldMan1_2::
	.string "Is that a RAINBOW WING?\p"
	.string "You may pass...$"
